    given-names: Apurv
    affiliation: "The Pennsylvania State University, USA"
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-10-21
repository-code: "https://github.com/apurvgaurav/proof-before-transfer"
url: "https://github.com/apurvgaurav/proof-before-transfer"
abstract: >-
  Preserved scientific inputs, model artifacts, saved predictions, retrospective
  baseline diagnostics and numerical verification source for a qualification-only
  study of a synthetic classical-regime TLS intrusion-detection pipeline. The
  X25519-to-X25519MLKEM768 transfer experiment was not run. The release records
  missing evidence and does not claim complete experimental reproduction.
